# Vite must not read a developer's .env or package-manager credentials at build time.
# Public build settings are supplied explicitly; example templates may remain.
**/.env*
**/*.env
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/.venv*
**/venv
**/env
**/.aws
**/.azure
**/.ssh
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/pip.conf
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
